{"id":"1615e311b8c1eba3","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-thm-donsker.md","title":"Donsker's Invariance Principle","display":"thm-donsker — Donsker's Invariance Principle","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-donsker","aliases":["58-thm-donsker"],"display":"thm-donsker — Donsker's Invariance Principle","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-brownian.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-iid.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-probability.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure8-distribution-law.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-prob3-weak-convergence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-donsker"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-donsker</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-donsker — Donsker's Invariance Principle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8fc074624288fbbb\" href=\"?note=8fc074624288fbbb\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-brownian.md\">../batch15/58-df-brownian.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64b5bf078722d744\" href=\"?note=64b5bf078722d744\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-iid.md\">../batch07/58-df-iid.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-probability.md\">../batch08/58-df-probability.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fb43b35d4bd6b3e\" href=\"?note=0fb43b35d4bd6b3e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure8-distribution-law.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure8-distribution-law.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fbf66bd653933f12\" href=\"?note=fbf66bd653933f12\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-prob3-weak-convergence.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-prob3-weak-convergence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\((\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> is a probability space and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^{\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}\">\\(X\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^{\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}\\)</span> has common law <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The increments satisfy <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[X_1]=0\">\\(\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[X_1]=0\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[X_1^2]=\\sigma^2\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[X_1^2]=\\sigma^2\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0=0\">\\(S_0=0\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n=\\sum_{k=1}^nX_k\">\\(S_n=\\sum_{k=1}^nX_k\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=D([0,1],\\mathbb R)\">\\(D=D([0,1],\\mathbb R)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{J_1}\">\\(\\tau_{J_1}\\)</span> is its Skorokhod topology, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(D)\">\\(\\mathcal B(D)\\)</span> is the induced Borel sigma algebra.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_n:\\Omega\\to D\">\\(W_n:\\Omega\\to D\\)</span> is the càdlàg step-path map <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_n(\\omega)(t)=S_{\\lfloor nt\\rfloor}(\\omega)/(\\sigma\\sqrt n)\">\\(W_n(\\omega)(t)=S_{\\lfloor nt\\rfloor}(\\omega)/(\\sigma\\sqrt n)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IID}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IID}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Brownian}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Brownian}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8DistributionLaw}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8DistributionLaw}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3WeakConvergence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb3WeakConvergence}_S\\)</span> are the exact predicates from the dependencies.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}donsker}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IID}_S(X,\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\mu;\n\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)),\\\\\n\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[X_1]=0,\\quad\n\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[X_1^2]=\\sigma^2\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\n\\end{array}\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\exists\\Omega_B,\\mathcal F_B,\\mathbb P_B,B,\\vec\\mu,\\mu_B\\in V\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(B,\\Omega_B,\\mathcal F_B,\\mathbb P_B)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8DistributionLaw}_S\n(\\vec\\mu(n-1),W_n,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,D,\\mathcal B(D))\n\\right.\\\\\n\\left.\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8DistributionLaw}_S\n(\\mu_B,\\omega_B\\mapsto(t\\mapsto B(t)(\\omega_B)),\n\\mathbb P_B,\\Omega_B,\\mathcal F_B,D,\\mathcal B(D))\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb3WeakConvergence}_S(D,\\tau_{J_1},\\vec\\mu,\\mu_B)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}donsker}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IID}_S(X,\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\mu;\n\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)),\\\\\n\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[X_1]=0,\\quad\n\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[X_1^2]=\\sigma^2\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\n\\end{array}\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\exists\\Omega_B,\\mathcal F_B,\\mathbb P_B,B,\\vec\\mu,\\mu_B\\in V\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(B,\\Omega_B,\\mathcal F_B,\\mathbb P_B)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8DistributionLaw}_S\n(\\vec\\mu(n-1),W_n,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,D,\\mathcal B(D))\n\\right.\\\\\n\\left.\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8DistributionLaw}_S\n(\\mu_B,\\omega_B\\mapsto(t\\mapsto B(t)(\\omega_B)),\n\\mathbb P_B,\\Omega_B,\\mathcal F_B,D,\\mathcal B(D))\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb3WeakConvergence}_S(D,\\tau_{J_1},\\vec\\mu,\\mu_B)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The conclusion compares explicit probability laws on the same path space; it does not confuse a stochastic process with its distribution.</li>\n<li>The step processes converge weakly in Skorokhod space with the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_1\">\\(J_1\\)</span> topology to Wiener measure.</li>\n<li>Piecewise-linear interpolation gives the equivalent formulation in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C([0,1])\">\\(C([0,1])\\)</span> with the uniform topology.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-brownian.md","status":"resolved","id":"8fc074624288fbbb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-brownian.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-iid.md","status":"resolved","id":"64b5bf078722d744","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-iid.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-probability.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-probability.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e4ee9615831113b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure8-distribution-law.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fb43b35d4bd6b3e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure8-distribution-law.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-prob3-weak-convergence.md","status":"resolved","id":"fbf66bd653933f12","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-prob3-weak-convergence.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^{\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[X_1]=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[X_1^2]=\\sigma^2\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"S_0=0","display":false},{"tex":"S_n=\\sum_{k=1}^nX_k","display":false},{"tex":"D=D([0,1],\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{J_1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(D)","display":false},{"tex":"W_n:\\Omega\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"W_n(\\omega)(t)=S_{\\lfloor nt\\rfloor}(\\omega)/(\\sigma\\sqrt n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IID}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Brownian}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8DistributionLaw}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3WeakConvergence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}donsker}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IID}_S(X,\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\mu;\n\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)),\\\\\n\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[X_1]=0,\\quad\n\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[X_1^2]=\\sigma^2\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\n\\end{array}\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\exists\\Omega_B,\\mathcal F_B,\\mathbb P_B,B,\\vec\\mu,\\mu_B\\in V\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(B,\\Omega_B,\\mathcal F_B,\\mathbb P_B)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8DistributionLaw}_S\n(\\vec\\mu(n-1),W_n,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,D,\\mathcal B(D))\n\\right.\\\\\n\\left.\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8DistributionLaw}_S\n(\\mu_B,\\omega_B\\mapsto(t\\mapsto B(t)(\\omega_B)),\n\\mathbb P_B,\\Omega_B,\\mathcal F_B,D,\\mathcal B(D))\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb3WeakConvergence}_S(D,\\tau_{J_1},\\vec\\mu,\\mu_B)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"J_1","display":false},{"tex":"C([0,1])","display":false}],"bytes":2477,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-thm-donsker.md|58-thm-donsker]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["8fc074624288fbbb","64b5bf078722d744","5e0db065132180df","2e4ee9615831113b","0fb43b35d4bd6b3e","fbf66bd653933f12"]}